    <header class="article-header">
      <span class="pill"><span data-lang="so">Cudurrada &amp; Cayayaanka</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>Pests &amp; Diseases</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>الآفات والأمراض</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>Wadudu na Magonjwa</span></span>
      <h1 class="article-title"><span data-lang="so">Powdery Mildew — Budada Caddaan ee Caleemaha</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>Powdery Mildew — White Powder on Leaves</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>البياض الدقيقي — مسحوق أبيض على الأوراق</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>Ukungu wa Unga — Unga Mweupe kwenye Majani</span></h1>
      <div class="article-meta"><span>2026-05-21</span><span><span data-lang="so">6 daqiiqo</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>6 min read</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>6 دقائق</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>dakika 6</span></span></div>
    </header>
    <div class="article-cover cover-powdery-mildew"></div>
    <div class="article-body">
      <p class="article-lead"><span data-lang="so">Powdery Mildew waa fangas keena budo cad oo sida budada wadaad ah oo caleemaha ku faafa. Waa mid ka mid ah cudurrada ugu badan, wuxuuna weeraraa khudaarta, miraha, iyo ubaxa.</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>Powdery Mildew is a fungus that produces a white, flour-like powder spreading over leaves. It is one of the most widespread diseases, attacking vegetables, fruit, and flowers.</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>البياض الدقيقي فطر ينتج مسحوقاً أبيض كالطحين ينتشر على الأوراق. من أكثر الأمراض انتشاراً، يصيب الخضار والفواكه والأزهار.</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>Ukungu wa Unga ni fangasi anayetoa unga mweupe kama wa ngano unaoenea kwenye majani. Ni mojawapo ya magonjwa yaliyoenea zaidi, hushambulia mboga, matunda, na maua.</span></p>

      <h2 class="article-h2"><span data-lang="so">Calaamadaha</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>Symptoms</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>الأعراض</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>Dalili</span></h2>
      <p class="article-p"><span data-lang="so">Budo cad ama cawlan ayaa ka muuqata dusha caleemaha, jirridda, iyo mararka qaar miraha. Caleemaha way maroojin, huraan, oo dhacaan. Si ka duwan cudurrada kale, wuxuu ku faafaa xitaa cimilada qalalan ee diirimaadka.</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>White or grey powder appears on the upper leaf surface, stems, and sometimes fruit. Leaves curl, yellow, and drop. Unlike other diseases, it spreads even in dry, warm weather.</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>مسحوق أبيض أو رمادي على السطح العلوي للأوراق والسيقان وأحياناً الثمار. تلتفّ الأوراق وتصفرّ وتتساقط. ينتشر حتى في الجو الجاف الدافئ.</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>Unga mweupe au wa kijivu kwenye uso wa juu wa majani, shina, na wakati mwingine matunda. Majani hujikunja, kuwa manjano, na kudondoka. Tofauti na magonjwa mengine, huenea hata katika hali kavu ya joto.</span></p>

      <h2 class="article-h2"><span data-lang="so">Dhirta Khasaaray</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>Affected Crops</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>المحاصيل المتأثرة</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>Mazao Yaliyoathirika</span></h2>
      <p class="article-p"><span data-lang="so">Qaraha, qajaarka, bocorka, basbaaska, yaanyada, cambaha, canabka, iyo ubaxyo badan. Dhirta hooska ku jirta ee hawo-mareen liidata leh ayaa ugu nugul.</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>Watermelon, cucumber, squash, pepper, tomato, mango, grapes, and many flowers. Plants in shade with poor airflow are most susceptible.</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>البطيخ والخيار والكوسة والفلفل والطماطم والمانجو والعنب وكثير من الأزهار. النباتات في الظل بتهوية ضعيفة الأكثر عرضة.</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>Tikiti maji, tango, boga, pilipili, nyanya, embe, zabibu, na maua mengi. Mimea kivulini yenye hewa duni iko hatarini zaidi.</span></p>

      <h2 class="article-h2"><span data-lang="so">Khasaaraha</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>Damage</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>الأضرار</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>Madhara</span></h2>
      <p class="article-p"><span data-lang="so">Budadu waxay xidhaa iftiinka (photosynthesis), taas oo yaraysa koritaanka iyo macaanka miraha. Weerar daran wuxuu yarayn karaa wax-soosaarka 20–40% wuxuuna dhirta yar dili karaa.</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>The powder blocks photosynthesis, reducing growth and fruit sweetness. A severe attack can cut yield by 20–40% and kill young plants.</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>المسحوق يعيق التمثيل الضوئي فيقلّ النمو وحلاوة الثمار. الإصابة الشديدة تخفض المحصول 20–40% وتقتل النباتات الصغيرة.</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>Unga huzuia photosynthesis, hupunguza ukuaji na utamu wa matunda. Shambulio kali hupunguza mavuno 20–40% na kuua mimea michanga.</span></p>

      <h2 class="article-h2"><span data-lang="so">Xakamayn iyo Daawayn</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>Control &amp; Treatment</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>المكافحة والعلاج</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>Udhibiti na Matibabu</span></h2>
      <ul class="article-list">
        <li><strong>Milk spray</strong> — <span data-lang="so">caano + biyo (1:9) waa daawo dabiici ah oo waxtar leh — ku rid 7 maalmood kasta.</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>milk + water (1:9) is an effective natural remedy — spray every 7 days.</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>حليب + ماء (1:9) علاج طبيعي فعّال — رش كل 7 أيام.</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>maziwa + maji (1:9) ni dawa asili bora — nyunyiza kila siku 7.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Bicarbonate</strong> — <span data-lang="so">potassium bicarbonate ama baking soda + saliid + saabuun.</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>potassium bicarbonate or baking soda + oil + soap.</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>بيكربونات البوتاسيوم أو صودا الخبز + زيت + صابون.</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>bicarbonate ya potashi au soda + mafuta + sabuni.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Sulfur/Fungicide</strong> — <span data-lang="so">sulfur ama fungicide gaar ah marka ay halis weyn tahay.</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>sulfur or a specific fungicide for severe cases.</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>كبريت أو مبيد فطري خاص للحالات الشديدة.</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>sulphur au dawa maalum kwa hali mbaya.</span></li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="article-h2"><span data-lang="so">Ka Hortagga</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>Prevention</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>الوقاية</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>Kuzuia</span></h2>
      <ul class="article-list">
        <li><strong></strong> — <span data-lang="so">Sii dhirta masaafo wanaagsan oo hawadu ku socoto.</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>Space plants well for good air circulation.</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>باعد النباتات لتهوية جيدة.</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>Acha nafasi nzuri kwa mzunguko wa hewa.</span></li>
        <li><strong></strong> — <span data-lang="so">Beero meel qorrax buuxda leh; iska ilaali hooska.</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>Plant in full sun; avoid shade.</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>ازرع في شمس كاملة؛ تجنب الظل.</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>Panda jua kamili; epuka kivuli.</span></li>
        <li><strong></strong> — <span data-lang="so">Isticmaal noocyo iska caabin u leh oo ha isticmaalin nitrogen xad-dhaaf ah.</span><span data-lang="en" hidden>Use resistant varieties and avoid excess nitrogen.</span><span data-lang="ar" hidden>استخدم أصنافاً مقاومة وتجنب فرط النيتروجين.</span><span data-lang="sw" hidden>Tumia aina sugu na epuka naitrojeni nyingi.</span></li>
      </ul>

